  <summary>This is my attempt of porting one of my favorite custom themes from Windows 7. Sort of that is. I just took some pngs from this style. Found there: https://www.deviantart.com/steel89/art/Cur7ed-Beta-Visual-Style-185687277&lt;br />
&lt;br />
What I have is is a combination of Volatile and the Cur7ed theme. With all these flat themes, I really missed the appeal of glossy transparency. The menu icon I sort of made. I got a copy of KDE Neon's icon and put a glassy effect to it. ;)&lt;br />
&lt;br />
Icons I am using are from here if interested: https://store.kde.org/p/1333537/</summary>
